      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRYOSEISMS (4) won a couple of BM55 sprints then stepped up to today's level last start and went within a whisker of the hat trick over 1100m at this track. Progressive three-year-old who draws a perfect gate and should get every chance to add to the recent excellent results. GUAC ON (5) led for home last time out but laboured late under 62kgs to finish third over 1200m at Mackay. Up in grade but gets some welcome weight relief. Coming back in trip looks the right move - expect him to be hard to beat at the third run back. ITALIAN DANCER (2) resumes. Trialled well at the Sunshine Coast recently and is capable of mixing it with these while fresh. KRACKACAN (3) caved in after leading here first-up last start. Distance specialist who can improve sharply. Last start Goondiwindi winner IDHANA (6) rounds out the small field - hard to make a case.",
